 "_comment": [
  "A SAVED COPY OF /api/cities?options=1, taken on 2026-09-28.",
  "",
  "Every slug the site publishes a destination page for, and nothing else: the",
  "live response also carries nameLocal, a flag and a search haystack, none of",
  "which this is for. What it is for is one selftest - that every siteSlug in",
  "destinations.json resolves to a page that exists - and that test must not",
  "make a network call, because a test that needs the internet is a test that",
  "fails on a train and gets deleted.",
  "",
  "It WILL go stale, and staleness here is safe in the direction that matters.",
  "A slug the site has since renamed fails the selftest loudly, which is the",
  "moment to re-take this file; a destination the site has ADDED since simply",
  "is not in here, and nothing claims it should be. Re-take it with:",
  "  node -e \"fetch(...).then(...)\"  - or just curl the URL and keep slug,",
  "name and country."
